WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.010 --> 00:00:04.700
You may have heard the word 'Benghazi' a
few times are few thousand times in the

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:06.000
past few years

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:06.720
– "Benghazi" –

00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:08.720
– "Probes about Benghazi" –

00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:10.020
– "Benghazi committee" –

00:00:10.020 --> 00:00:11.520
–&nbsp;"You wouldn't have had your Benghazi situation" –

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:14.400
Whether from Fox News and
Republicans in Congress who insist it's

00:00:14.410 --> 00:00:19.610
a major scandal or some liberals joking
about it on Twitter, it all has to do with Republicans'

00:00:19.610 --> 00:00:22.800
deeper beliefs about Barack Obama's
presidency and with the politics

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:25.400
surrounding Hillary Clinton's presidential
campaign.

00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:28.880
But to see how Benghazi fits into all of
that you need to know exactly what

00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:32.590
happened in Benghazi, in the first place.

00:00:32.590 --> 00:00:36.410
On the night of September 11th 2012 a
group of Islamist militia members

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:40.220
attacked a US diplomatic outpost in
Benghazi Libya. They killed four

00:00:40.220 --> 00:00:44.430
Americans including the US ambassador to
Libya Chris Stevens who was visiting from

00:00:44.430 --> 00:00:49.040
Tripoli that week. The city was a centre
of the US-backed rebellion that toppled

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:52.670
Muammar Qaddafi the year before, and a number of armed groups had emerged in

00:00:52.670 --> 00:00:56.699
the aftermath. It was a dangerous environment. However, the US had no

00:00:56.699 --> 00:01:01.750
intelligence suggesting a specific attack was imminent. At 9:42 pm, the

00:01:01.750 --> 00:01:04.869
the militiamen easily breached the gates of the compound and set fire to the

00:01:04.869 --> 00:01:09.440
building. A subsequent State Department
review blamed systemic failures at the

00:01:09.440 --> 00:01:13.509
department's senior levels for the
mission's poor security. Stevens had

00:01:13.509 --> 00:01:18.540
previously requested more security and
not gotten it. In the chaos of the attack

00:01:18.540 --> 00:01:22.520
US security officers were separated
from Stevens and Sean Smith, another

00:01:22.520 --> 00:01:26.229
State Department official. The two men
died of smoke inhalation later that

00:01:26.229 --> 00:01:28.310
night

00:01:28.310 --> 00:01:33.280
A team from the nearby CIA annex arrived and engaged militants before taking survivors back

00:01:33.280 --> 00:01:38.890
to the extra mile away at 11:15PM.  40
minutes later the attackers laid siege

00:01:38.890 --> 00:01:40.610
to the annex as well.

00:01:40.610 --> 00:01:45.659
resumed around 5:15 a.m. with two more
Americans security agents Tyrone Woods

00:01:45.659 --> 00:01:50.049
and Glen Doherty killed by mortars
firing on the annex. This later became a

00:01:50.049 --> 00:01:54.399
big controversy. Republicans accused
Obama of withholding further military

00:01:54.399 --> 00:01:57.850
support that might have saved the day. 
But there were simply no military assets

00:01:57.850 --> 00:02:01.880
that could have gotten there in time. Starting
around 7 a.m. the Americans were able to

00:02:01.880 --> 00:02:06.000
escape the compound and leave the country. The CIA initially blamed the attack on a mob

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:09.360
protesting an anti-Islam movie which had
sparked protests elsewhere in the middle

00:02:09.360 --> 00:02:13.260
east. Then UN Ambassador Susan Rice made
this claim on several Sunday talk shows

00:02:13.260 --> 00:02:20.390
RICE: it began spontaneously in Benghazi as a reaction to what had transpired some

00:02:20.390 --> 00:02:22.100
RICE:hours earlier in cairo.

00:02:22.100 --> 00:02:24.640
That turned out to
be mostly wrong. The attackers were members

00:02:24.720 --> 00:02:29.400
of Islamist militias we now know; not
random mob. Republicans accuse the Obama

00:02:29.400 --> 00:02:32.980
administration of campaign with
intelligence specifically in races

00:02:32.980 --> 00:02:36.459
talking points for the sunday shows to
hide the fact there was a terrorist

00:02:36.459 --> 00:02:37.100
attack.

00:02:37.100 --> 00:02:40.900
WALLACE: Did the Obama administration
play down what happened in Libya what

00:02:41.040 --> 00:02:46.650
WALLACE: happened in cairo because it would make
Obama foreign policy look better?

00:02:46.650 --> 00:02:50.459
But later investigation showed that she'd
honestly repeated CIA analysis rather

00:02:50.459 --> 00:02:54.590
than deliberately lying. Still, amidst the
controversy, Rice withdrew herself from

00:02:54.590 --> 00:02:59.280
consideration to become the next
Secretary of State

00:02:59.280 --> 00:03:03.200
There have been eight official investigations into
Benghazi mostly involving or led by

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:08.220
congressional Republicans and none has
found any real evidence of a cover-up, or

00:03:08.220 --> 00:03:11.590
wrongdoing by the administration with
the exception of the state department's

00:03:11.590 --> 00:03:14.849
internal report blaming its own
incompetence for failing to provide

00:03:14.849 --> 00:03:19.400
sufficient security. So why are republicans
still investigating? Partly out of a

00:03:19.400 --> 00:03:21.109
certainty that something was wrong

00:03:21.109 --> 00:03:24.530
stemming from deep-seated Republican
beliefs that Obama is both week on

00:03:24.530 --> 00:03:29.060
terror in corruptly authoritarian, enough
to hide the truth. But this is also about

00:03:29.060 --> 00:03:33.439
politics. Republicans want to embarrass
Obama and damage Hillary Clinton who was

00:03:33.439 --> 00:03:35.879
then Secretary of State the time of the
attack.

00:03:35.879 --> 00:03:38.799
House majority leader Kevin McCarthy
admitted as much on national television.

00:03:38.799 --> 00:03:43.900
MCCARTHY: Everybody thought Hillary Clinton was unbeatable right? but we put together

00:03:43.900 --> 00:03:50.230
MCCARTHY: a Benghazi special committee. A select committee. What are her numbers today? Her

00:03:50.230 --> 00:03:52.000
MCCARTHY: numbers are dropping. Why? Cause she's untrustable.

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:55.780
And its kind of worked. The Clinton

00:03:55.840 --> 00:03:59.430
email scandal rose from one of the
Benghazi investigations. So you can bet

00:03:59.430 --> 00:04:01.750
we'll be hearing about Benghazi well
into the presidential election.

